   129	**Physical challenge or learning encounter per movement:** M1 the wash recovery, the hold drilled, the Thornwater stretch walked at dusk · M2 the ford (developed fight), the well, Lira's first runs on a stiff ankle · M3 the fan haul, the bench, the stampede (terrain fight), the lip · M4 the perimeter walk and the six trials inside the line (a learning encounter for every one of the six) · M5 the Ring (central set piece), the deep reading · M6 **the deliberate quieter movement:** the bowman's one-armed shooting lessons, Cael relearning the Wind economy in Thornwater's yard under the listening, and the strata demonstration · M7 the run to the stair, the stalemate, the ascent and the rim · M8 the wyrm trials and the Hall, then the walk home into first snow.
