   217	| M8 | The wyrm trials (bulge, stone at eleven, skip, the fixed point) | 2,500 | Learning (the rule taught cold) |
   218	| M8 | **The Drowned Hall:** a blind thing that strikes what stays, in water, with no Paths | 5,000–6,000 | Together-fight; the found family's for this book |
   219	
   220	Every winning mechanism is taught before it is used: discharge sense (ford → Ring); flight (herd day → stampede); the line (perimeter trials → Ring, Stair); Anchor unbinding (edition B6 ch31/ch33/ch38 → Stair) [B6-reconciled 2026-10-11: audit C1]; strike-what-stays (afternoon → Hall). Each win is writable as *X removed Y's ability to Z* (source checkpoint). The opponent learns: the pack at the ford stops testing silent bodies; the rim waits instead of entering.
   221	
   222	**Injuries tracked forward (no silent healing):** Cael's calf (53 → reopened 78 and 96 → closed 99); ribs (78 → taped 81 → off 99 → the Hall's bill 119 → cold-aggravated 123 → quiet at 129). Lira's right ankle (53, 78, 96; **never mended**); her leg (broken 78, mended 80); her left forearm (96 → season order → reopened 114 → closed; slung at 131). Brom's forearm (53 → reopened 78 → mended 80); his hand (96 → mended 97); his shoulder (114 → mended; reopened 119 → mended twice → bound 120). Karis's palms (53, scars); empty (78); throat and voice (96 → mended 97, voice back by ~110). Seln: unmarked. Oryn: drained at every mending, priced aloud.
